This Decree shall enter into force on November 30, 2003.

Article 2 (Special provisions concerning composition of the committee of the Port Authority established at Busan Port)
Notwithstanding Article 5 (2), until December 31, 2006, the committee of the Port Authority established at Busan Port shall consist of 11 non-standing members, including:
1. Five persons recommended by the Mayor of Busan Metropolitan City (including one representative of organizations of users of the port);
2. Two representatives of organizations of users of the port.

Article 3 (Amendments to other statutes)
① Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Act on Contributions in Kind of State Property shall be amended as follows:
Subparagraph 54 shall be newly inserted in Article 2 as follows:
54. Port authorities under the Port Authority Act.
② Part of the Regulations on Delegation and Entrustment of Administrative Authority shall be amended as follows:
Subparagraph 10 shall be newly inserted in Article 40 (1) as follows:
10. The following matters under the Port Authority Act (hereinafter referred to as the "Act" in this subparagraph):
(a) Approval of implementation plans (including amendments), consultation with the heads of competent administrative agencies, and public notification in the Official Gazette under Article 22 of the Act;
(b) Confirmation of completion, issuance of certificates thereof, public notification in the Official Gazette and permission for use before completion under Article 24 of the Act;
(c) Guidance and supervision of port authorities under Article 37 of the Act and Article 29, subparagraphs 1 through 4 of its Enforcement Decree;
(d) Imposition and collection of administrative fines under Article 42 of the Act.
Paragraph ⑧ shall be newly inserted in Article 52 as follows:
⑧ Under the main sentence of Article 5 of the Open Ports Order Act, the head of a regional office of oceans and fisheries shall entrust the Port Authority with the acceptance of reports on arrivals and departures of vessels at the port limit of an open port where a Port Authority is established under the Port Authority Act.
③ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on Safety Management of Facilities shall be amended as follows:
