⑤ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Act on Aggravated Punishment, etc. of Specific Crimes shall be amended as follows:
Subparagraph 53 shall be newly inserted in Article 2 as follows:
53. Port authorities under the Port Authority Act.
⑥ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Countermeasures against Natural Disasters Act shall be amended as follows:
Subparagraph 32 shall be newly inserted in Article 2 as follows:
32. Presidents of port authorities under the Port Authority Act.
⑦ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Disaster Management Act shall be amended as follows:
Article 2 (1) 28 shall be renumbered as subparagraph 29, and a new subparagraph 28 shall be inserted as follows:
28. Port authorities under the Port Authority Act.
⑧ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Act on Assessment of Impacts of Works on Environment, Traffic, Disasters, etc. shall be amended as follows:
The column concerning timing of submission of an assessment statement or request for consultation in attached Table 1, subparagraph 1 (d) (2) shall be replaced with the following:
Where works are implemented by the management authority, before public notification of port works under Article 9 (4) of the Harbor Act; where implemented by a person other than the management authority, before permission for a plan under Article 9 (2) of that Act; and where implemented by a Port Authority under the Port Authority Act, before approval of an implementation plan under Article 22 of the Port Authority Act.
The column concerning timing of submission of an assessment statement or request for consultation in attached Table 1, subparagraph 2 (a) (4) shall be replaced with the following:
Before establishment or approval of an implementation plan under Article 10 of the Harbor Act: Provided, That for works implemented by a Port Authority under the Port Authority Act, before approval of an implementation plan under Article 22 of that Act.
⑨ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Energy Use Rationalization Act shall be amended as follows:
The column concerning timing of submission of an energy use plan in attached Table 1, subparagraph 1 (d) (1) shall be replaced with the following:
Where implemented by the Minister of Oceans and Fisheries or a Mayor/Do Governor, before public announcement of an implementation plan under Article 10 (1) of the Harbor Act; where implemented by a Port Authority under the Port Authority Act, before application for approval of an implementation plan under Article 22 of the Port Authority Act; and otherwise, before application for approval of an implementation plan under Article 10 (2) of the Harbor Act.
⑩ Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Act on Acquisition of and Compensation for Land, etc. for Public Works Projects shall be amended as follows:
Subparagraph 16 shall be newly inserted in Article 25 as follows:
16. Port authorities under the Port Authority Act.

ADDENDA (ENFORCEMENT DECREE OF THE ACT ON PUBLIC-PRIVATE PARTNERSHIPS IN INFRASTRUCTURE) <Presidential Decree No. 18736, 2005.3.8>
