Article 4 (Amendments to other statutes) ① through <23> Omitted.
<24> Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Port Authority Act shall be amended as follows:
In Article 4 (1) 6 and paragraph (2) of the same Article, "Act on Private Investment in Social Overhead Capital Facilities" shall be replaced with "Act on Public-Private Partnerships in Infrastructure".
